  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Advancing Climate Resilience and Women&#x2019;s Empowerment in Moldova</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The project aims to enhance climate resilience and gender equality in rural Moldova by promoting sustainable management of forest, pasture, and agricultural resources, while economically empowering women. It focuses on building resilient communities by encouraging women to engage in afforestation, silvo-pastoral, and agroforestry practices.</narrative>
  </description>
